Feature: The canopy and the radio
  In the [[v4 rules]], the forest blocks the radio of a drone below the treetops. A low drone is in
  contact only within 250 m of a friendly radio: its base, a tower that its team holds, or a
  friend above the trees that is in contact. A drone above the trees is in contact anywhere outside
  a [[radio shadow]]. Thus the towers that a team holds are its radio network, and a drone that
  takes a tower far from them goes dark until the tower is its team's.

  A drone with a [[relay]] carries the radio 300 m for its friends, in the forest or in a radio
  shadow. It is the one way to keep a drone in a shadow in contact from far away.

  Expectation: A low drone far from the radio of its team is out of contact
    Given the canopy is on
    And the west tower is neutral
    And the first Blue drone is in the west circle
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 1
    And the second Blue drone is at its base
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is cut

  Expectation: A tower that the team holds carries the radio of its low drones
    Overrides: A low drone far from the radio of its team is out of contact

    Given the canopy is on
    And the west tower is held by Blue
    And the towers held by Blue are 2
    And the first Blue drone is in the west circle
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 1
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact

  Expectation: A low drone near its home tower is in contact
    Given the canopy is on
    And the first Blue drone is at the Blue home tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact

  Expectation: A friend above the trees carries the radio of a low drone near it
    Given the canopy is on
    And the west tower is neutral
    And the first Blue drone is in the west circle
    And the Blue drones in the west circle are 1
    And the second Blue drone is high over the west tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact

  Expectation: A drone above the trees is in contact with no friend near
    Given the canopy is on
    And the west tower is neutral
    And the first Blue drone is 130 m from the west tower
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact

  Expectation: A relay carries the radio into a radio shadow
    Without the relay, a friend 80 m away is too far (see [[The mesh]]).

    Given the canopy is on
    And the Red home tower is held by Red
    And the first Blue drone is 150 m from the Red home tower
    And the second Blue drone is 230 m from the Red home tower
    And the payload of the second Blue drone is a relay
    Then the link of the first Blue drone is in contact
